# Contributing

Thanks for your interest in contributing to atharsocial!

- Please open issues for bug reports or feature requests.
- Fork the repo and create a branch for your change (feature/<desc> or fix/<issue>-<desc>). 
- Open a pull request against main from your branch.
- Ensure linting and tests pass (if any).

Thanks! 
``` ````

````markdown name=CODE_OF_CONDUCT.md
# Code of Conduct

This project follows the Contributor Covenant code of conduct. By participating, you agree to abide by its terms.

Please be respectful, constructive, and inclusive. Report any issues to the repository maintainers.

(See https://www.contributor-covenant.org/ for full text.)
